; The tally of points earned in all (t0 nothing yet .. t3 more than 60: the first worlds paid 16 and 22, Module 03 / lore "Post
; points"), which opens the Ghost Market. storyLogic.cjs adds the postman's state from story.sqlite: in reality or in a world (an
; advancement world when its name says tiến giai), the rank, the missions given and finished (100%), the stamp book, the stamps.
(define (problem mailman-world) (:domain mailman)
  (:objects t0 t1 t2 t3 - tally)
  (:init (next-tally t0 t1) (next-tally t1 t2) (next-tally t2 t3) (market-open t3))
  (:goal (and)))
